From 87ba49a089ed504ce9a3e90e8095250a13971062 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "live-speech-filter (local)" <local@live-speech-filter.invalid>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 06:33:43 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] censor-engine: recognition, word matching, muting and the
 delay line move out of ProfanityFilter into CensorEngine
 (censor-engine.cpp/.hpp), which reads settings, lexicon, source name, pinyin
 dictionary and the 16 kHz resampler through a CensorHost interface and logs
 through censor-log.hpp; ProfanityFilter becomes the OBS host (libobs
 audio_resampler, blog, plugin config); word list building and pattern parsing
 are shared functions; no change in plugin behaviour, so a standalone program
 can use the same engine

